<h3 class="govuk-heading-s">Monitoring approved developments</h3>
<p class="govuk-body">If the application is approved, the relevant local planning authority monitors the development.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">They will check that the work follows the approved plans and any planning conditions.</p>
<h3 >Challenging a decision</h3>
<p class="govuk-body">You can apply to the High Court for a judicial review if you want to challenge the decision. You must submit your application to the High Court within 6 weeks of the decision date.</p>
